<p>Fires out a bolt of pure energy, dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">165, 223, 267, 304, 338</acronym> light and 0.00 darkness damage in a radius of 1, and slowing targets hit. Their movement is reduced by 0% and attacking, casting and mind attacks by <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">27%, 30%, 30%, 30%, 30%.</acronym> The bolt will attune to your current positive and negative energy amounts.</p>